# text = The answer may seem to lie quite on the surface :-- in her beauty , a certain unusualness about her , a decision of will which made itself felt in her graceful movements and clear unhesitating tones , so that if she came into the room on a rainy day when everybody else was flaccid and the use of things in general was not apparent to them , there seemed to be a sudden , sufficient reason for keeping up the forms of life ; and even the waiters at hotels showed the more alacrity in doing away with crumbs and creases and dregs with struggling flies in them .
