# text = Arrowpoint thought But Gwendolen , nevertheless , continued to receive polite attentions from the family at Quetcham , not merely because invitations have larger grounds than those of personal liking , but because the trying little scene at the piano had awakened a kindly solicitude toward her in the gentle mind of Miss Arrowpoint , who managed all the invitations and visits , her mother being otherwise occupied FONTENELLE : _Pluralite des Mondes_ .
