# text = Then he said , nervously said Mr . Gascoigne , laying down his pen , leaning back in his chair , and looking at Rex with more marked examination Mr . Gascoigne left a brief interval of silence , and then said , with quiet irony Poor Rex felt his heart swelling and comporting itself as if it had been no better than a girl's here Rex bit his lips and felt the tears starting , to his great vexation ; then he rallied and tried to say more firmly Rex broke down .
