# text = Some readers of this history will doubtless regard it as incredible that people should construct matrimonial prospects on the mere report that a bachelor of good fortune and possibilities was coming within reach , and will reject the statement as a mere outflow of gall : they will aver that neither they nor their first cousins have minds so unbridled ; and that in fact this is not human nature , which would know that such speculations might turn out to be fallacious , and would therefore not entertain them .
