# text = Draped in a loose garment with a Florentine _berretta_ on his head , he would have been fit to stand by the side of Leonardo de Vinci ; but how when he presented himself in trousers which were not what English feeling demanded about the knees ?-- and when the fire that showed itself in his glances and the movements of his head , as he looked round him with curiosity , was turned into comedy by a hat which ruled that mankind should have well-cropped hair and a staid demeanor , such , for example , as Mr . Arrowsmith's , whose nullity of face and perfect tailoring might pass everywhere without ridicule ?
