# text = This movement for the sake of being in sight of her was more direct than usual rather late in the evening , when Gwendolen had accepted Klesmer as a partner ; and that wide-glancing personage , who saw everything and nothing by turns , said to her when they were walking said Gwendolen , with a light laugh ; she was quite courageous with Klesmer now said Klesmer , quickly , with one of his grand frowns , while he shook his hand as if to banish the discordant sounds said the terrible Klesmer said Klesmer , suddenly dropping from his quick narrative to a reflective tone , with an impressive frown said Gwendolen , not without some wickedness of intention .
