# text = Gwendolen thought the scheme delightful -- equal to playing Robin Hood and Maid Marian : and Mr . Grandcourt , when appealed to a second time , said it was a thing to be done ; whereupon Mr . Lush , who stood behind Lady Brackenshaw's elbow , drew Gwendolen's notice by saying with a familiar look and tone to Grandcourt Impossible to look more unconscious of being addressed than Grandcourt ; but Gwendolen took a new survey of the speaker , deciding , first , that he must be on terms of intimacy with the tenant of Diplow , and , secondly , that she would never , if she could help it , let him come within a yard of her .
