# text = But this last brief speech was uttered in subdued inward , yet distinct , tones , which Lush had long been used to recognize as the expression of a peremptory will Lush spoke carelessly , but he was really seizing an opportunity and fixing an observant look on Grandcourt , who now for the first time , turned his eyes toward his companion , but slowly and without speaking until he had given two long luxuriant puffs , when he said , perhaps in a lower tone than ever , but with a perceptible edge of contempt said Lush , jocosely Grandcourt did not answer , and Lush went on Here it was Lush who made a little pause before speaking again , and then he said in a deep voice of remonstrance Lush put down his cigar and thrust his hands into his side pockets , as if he had to face something exasperating , but meant to keep his temper
