# text = While she was going back to England , Grandcourt was coming to find her ; coming , that is , after his own manner -- not in haste by express straight from Diplow to Leubronn , where she was understood to be ; but so entirely without hurry that he was induced by the presence of some Russian acquaintances to linger at Baden-Baden and make various appointments with them , which , however , his desire to be at Leubronn ultimately caused him to break .
