# text = He had always called Sir Hugo Mallinger his uncle , and when it once occurred to him to ask about his father and mother , the baronet had answered Daniel then straining to discern something in that early twilight , had a dim sense of having been kissed very much , and surrounded by thin , cloudy , scented drapery , till his ringers caught in something hard , which hurt him , and he began to cry .
