# text = This last had married Miss Grandcourt , and taken her name along with her estates , thus making a junction between two equally old families , impaling the three Saracens' heads proper and three bezants of the one with the tower and falcons _argent_ of the other , and , as it happened , uniting their highest advantages in the prospects of that Henleigh Mallinger Grandcourt who is at present more of an acquaintance to us than either Sir Hugo or his nephew Daniel Deronda .
