# text = He had often stayed in London with Sir Hugo , who to indulge the boy's ear had carried him to the opera to hear the great tenors , so that the image of a singer taking the house by storm was very vivid to him ; but now , spite of his musical gift , he set himself bitterly against the notion of being dressed up to sing before all those fine people , who would not care about him except as a wonderful toy .
