# text = Every one interested in him agreed that he might have taken a high place if his motives had been of a more pushing sort , and if he had not , instead of regarding studies as instruments of success , hampered himself with the notion that they were to feed motive and opinion -- a notion which set him criticising methods and arguing against his freight and harness when he should have been using all his might to pull .
