# text = That delight , and the favorable opinion of his tutor , determined him to try for a mathematical scholarship in the Easter of his second year : he wished to gratify Sir Hugo by some achievement , and the study of the higher mathematics , having the growing fascination inherent in all thinking which demands intensity , was making him a more exclusive worker than he had been before .
