# text = He looked out for a perfectly solitary spot where he could lodge his boat against the bank , and , throwing himself on his back with his head propped on the cushions , could watch out the light of sunset and the opening of that bead-roll which some oriental poet describes as God's call to the little stars , who each answer He chose a spot in the bend of the river just opposite Kew Gardens , where he had a great breadth of water before him reflecting the glory of the sky , while he himself was in shadow .
