# text = Behind , of course , were the sad faces of the four superfluous girls , each , poor thing -- like those other many thousand sisters of us all -- having her peculiar world which was of no importance to any one else , but all of them feeling Gwendolen's presence to be somehow a relenting of misfortune : where Gwendolen was , something interesting would happen ; even her hurried submission to their kisses , and carried the sort of comfort which all weakness finds in decision and authoritativeness .
