# text = The more obvious beauty , also adorable sometimes -- one may say it without blasphemy -- begins by being an apology for folly , and ends like other apologies in becoming tiresome by iteration ; and that Klesmer , though very susceptible to it , should have a passionate attachment to Miss Arrowpoint , was no more a paradox than any other triumph of a manifold sympathy over a monotonous attraction .
