# text = Meanwhile enters the expectant peer , Mr . Bult , an esteemed party man who , rather neutral in private life , had strong opinions concerning the districts of the Niger , was much at home also in Brazils , spoke with decision of affairs in the South Seas , was studious of his Parliamentary and itinerant speeches , and had the general solidity and suffusive pinkness of a healthy Briton on the central table-land of life .
