# text = Catherine , always sorry when Klesmer gave himself airs , found an opportunity the next day in the music-room to say said Klesmer , rather fiercely said Catherine , smiling said Catherine , with some betrayal of feeling Klesmer , who had been seated at a table looking over scores , started up and walked to a little distance , from which he said There was no answer said Klesmer , with some irritation said Klesmer , going to seat himself at the piano , and touching the keys so as to give with the delicacy of an echo in the far distance a melody which he had set to Heine's said Catherine , not wanting to affect anything , but from mere agitation .
