# text = At home , at school , among acquaintances , she had been used to have her conscious superiority admitted ; and she had moved in a society where everything , from low arithmetic to high art , is of the amateur kind , politely supposed to fall short of perfection only because gentlemen and ladies are not obliged to do more than they like -- otherwise they would probably give forth abler writings , and show themselves more commanding artists than any the world is at present obliged to put up with .
