# text = Some beautiful girls who , like her , had read romances where even plain governesses are centres of attraction and are sought in marriage , might have solaced themselves a little by transporting such pictures into their own future ; but even if Gwendolen's experience had led her to dwell on love-making and marriage as her elysium , her heart was too much oppressed by what was near to her , in both the past and the future , for her to project her anticipations very far off .
