# text = Yet perhaps some who have afterward made themselves a willing fence before the breast of another , and have carried their own heart-wound in heroic silence -- some who have made their deeds great , nevertheless began with this angry amazement at their own smart , and on the mere denial of their fantastic desires raged as if under the sting of wasps which reduced the universe for them to an unjust infliction of pain .
