# text = But Mirah , with her terrified flight from one parent , and her yearning after the other , had flashed on him the hitherto neglected reality that Judaism was something still throbbing in human lives , still making for them the only conceivable vesture of the world ; and in the idling excursion on which he immediately afterward set out with Sir Hugo he began to look for the outsides of synagogues , and the title of books about the Jews .
