# text = He was ceasing to care for knowledge -- he had no ambition for practice -- unless they could both be gathered up into one current with his emotions ; and he dreaded , as if it were a dwelling - place of lost souls , that dead anatomy of culture which turns the universe into a mere ceaseless answer to queries , and knows , not everything , but everything else about everything -- as if one should be ignorant of nothing concerning the scent of violets except the scent itself for which one had no nostril .
