# text = The whole scene was a coherent strain , its burden a passionate regret , which , if he had known the liturgy for the Day of Reconciliation , he might have clad in its authentic burden But with the cessation of the devotional sounds and the movement of many indifferent faces and vulgar figures before him there darted into his mind the frigid idea that he had probably been alone in his feeling , and perhaps the only person in the congregation for whom the service was more than a dull routine .
