# text = No doubt wickedness hath its rewards to distribute ; but who so wins in this devil's game must needs be baser , more cruel , more brutal than the order of this planet will allow for the multitude born of woman , the most of these carrying a form of conscience -- a fear which is the shadow of justice , a pity which is the shadow of love -- that hindereth from the prize of serene wickedness , itself difficult of maintenance in our composite flesh .
