# text = On their way to the buttery and kitchen they took the outside of the house and paused before a beautiful pointed doorway , which was the only old remnant in the east front said Sir Hugo drawled Grandcourt said Sir Hugo , in a tone of confidential assent said Deronda said Sir Hugo , laughingly said Gwendolen , taking advantage of the freedom of grouping to fall back a little , while Sir Hugo and Grandcourt went on said Gwendolen with a little surprise said Deronda , smiling at her sudden _naivete_ said Gwendolen , putting up her chin in her old saucy manner said Deronda , gravely .
