# text = With the low wintry afternoon sun upon it , sending shadows from the cedar boughs , and lighting up the touches of snow remaining on every ledge , it had still a scarcely disturbed aspect of antique solemnity , which gave the scene in the interior rather a startling effect ; though , ecclesiastical or reverential indignation apart , the eyes could hardly help dwelling with pleasure on its piquant picturesqueness .
