# text = He rose hastily , turned round , and pushed away his chair with a strong expression of surprise said Gwendolen said Deronda said Gwendolen said Gwendolen , speaking quickly in a subdued tone , while she walked forward and rested her arms and muff on the back of the chair he had pushed away from him The hurried directness with which she spoke -- the absence of all her little airs , as if she were only concerned to use the time in getting an answer that would guide her , made her appeal unspeakably touching .
