# text = The aspect and action of Mordecai were so new and mysterious to Jacob -- they carried such a burden of obscure threat -- it was as if the patient , indulgent companion had turned into something unknown and terrific : the sunken dark eyes and hoarse accents close to him , the thin grappling fingers , shook Jacob's little frame into awe , and while Mordecai was speaking he stood trembling with a sense that the house was tumbling in and they were not going to have dinner any more .
