# text = After turning his back on the visitor that Sabbath evening , Mordecai went through days of a deep discouragement , like that of men on a doomed ship , who having strained their eyes after a sail , and beheld it with rejoicing , behold it never advance , and say But the long-contemplated figure had come as an emotional sequence of Mordecai's firmest theoretic convictions ; it had been wrought from the imagery of his most passionate life ; and it inevitably reappeared -- reappeared in a more specific self - asserting form than ever .
