# text = Mirah in her childlike way turned toward him to be looked at ; and he , going to a little further distance , knelt with one knee on a hassock to survey her she said , pleadingly said Hans , with a considering air said Amy said Mirah said Hans , who had suddenly become as fastidious and conventional on this occasion as he had thought Deronda was , apropos of the Berenice-pictures Hans had a secret desire to neutralize the Jewess in private life , which he was in danger of not keeping secret said Mirah said Hans , with a devout look said Mirah , with a smile , which was rather maddening to Hans and made him feel still more of a cosmopolitan he said , his face creasing merrily said Amy said Mirah , entreatingly here she looked at Hans said Hans , overcome by this misplaced trust said Mirah , after a momentary pause of surprise said Hans , starting up with a sense of being checkmated said Amy said Mirah , looking doubtfully at Mrs .
