# text = It was the face of Mordecai , who also , in his watch toward the west , had caught sight of the advancing boat , and had kept it fast within his gaze , at first simply because it was advancing , then with a recovery of impressions that made him quiver as with a presentiment , till at last the nearing figure lifted up its face toward him -- the face of his visions -- and then immediately , with white uplifted hand , beckoned again and again .
