# text = The very sharpness with which these words penetrated Deronda made him feel the more that here was a crisis in which he must be firm he answered Mordecai had folded his arms again while Deronda was speaking , and now answered with equal firmness , though with difficult breathing Deronda felt a new chord sounding in his speech : it was rather imperious than appealing -- had more of conscious power than of the yearning need which had acted as a beseeching grasp on him before .
