# text = The cool Buchan was the first to speak , and hint the loss of time said he said Miller , who liked his joke , and would not have objected to be called Voltairian said the ready Pash said Mordecai said Lily said Miller said Pash said Lily said Mordecai , leaning forward again with his former eagerness Here Mordecai , whose seat was next the fireplace , rose and leaned his arm on the little shelf ; his excitement had risen , though his voice , which had begun with unusual strength , was getting hoarser Mordecai's voice had sunk , but with the hectic brilliancy of his gaze it was not the less impressive .
