# text = She was nearer to Deronda than before : was it surprising that he came up in time to shake hands before the music began -- then , that after he had stood a little while by the elbow of the settee at the empty end , the torrent-like confluences of bass and treble seemed , like a convulsion of nature , to cast the conduct of petty mortals into insignificance , and to warrant his sitting down ?
