# text = But one morning when they were breakfasting , Gwendolen , in a recurrent fit of determination to exercise the old spirit , said , dallying prettily over her prawns without eating them said Grandcourt , languidly echoed Gwendolen , playing at sauciness said Grandcourt , pushing away his plate , and leaning back in his chair while he looked at her with his most lizard-like expression and , played with the ears of the tiny spaniel on his lap ( Gwendolen had taken a dislike to the dogs because they fawned on him ).
