# text = His former visit to the superb city had been only cursory , and left him much to learn beyond the prescribed round of sight-seeing , by spending the cooler hours in observant wandering about the streets , the quay , and the environs ; and he often took a boat that he might enjoy the magnificent view of the city and harbor from the sea .
