# text = She did so with strange abruptness , turning her eyes upon him suddenly , and saying more quickly said Deronda , meeting her sharp gaze solemnly said the mother here her tone changed to one of a more bitter incisiveness said Deronda , impulsively she pointed with her forefinger to her breast she spread out her hands , palm upward , on each side of her , as she paused with a bitter compression of her lip , then let her voice fall into muffled , rapid utterance she spread out her hands again said Deronda , trying by this reference to the past to escape from what to him was the heart-rending piteousness of this mingled suffering and defiance said the Princess , shaking her head and folding her arms with an air of decision said Deronda , eager to know particulars that he feared his mother might not think of .
