# text = And thus , without any hardness to the poor Tuscan lady , who had her deliverance long ago , one may feel warranted in thinking of her with a less sympathetic interest than of the better known Gwendolen who , instead of being delivered from her errors or earth and cleansed from their effect in purgatory , is at the very height of her entanglement in those fatal meshes which are woven within more closely than without , and often make the inward torture disproportionate to what is discernable as outward cause .
