# text = Moreover , Gwendolen herself liked the sea : it did not make her ill ; and to observe the rigging of the vessel and forecast the necessary adjustments was a sort of amusement that might have gratified her activity and enjoyment of imaginary rule ; the weather was fine , and they were coasting southward , where even the rain-furrowed , heat-cracked clay becomes gem-like with purple shadows , and where one may float between blue and blue in an open - eyed dream that the world has done with sorrow .
