# text = Grandcourt had intense satisfaction in leading his wife captive after this fashion ; it gave their life on a small scale a royal representation and publicity in which every thing familiar was got rid of , and every body must do what was expected of them whatever might be their private protest -- the protest ( kept strictly private ) adding to the piquancy of despotism .
