# text = The beings closest to us , whether in love or hate , are often virtually our interpreters of the world , and some feather-headed gentleman or lady whom in passing we regret to take as legal tender for a human being , may be acting as a melancholy theory of life in the minds of those who live with them -- like a piece of yellow and wavy glass that distorts form and makes color an affliction .
