# text = Gwendolen thought of hours when she would be alone , since Grandcourt would not want to take her in the said boat , and in her exultation at this unlooked-for relief , she had wild , contradictory fancies of what she might do with her freedom -- that " running away " which she had already innumerable times seen to be a worse evil than any actual endurance , now finding new arguments as an escape from her worse self .
