# text = But soon there was no longer any doubt : the boat was being pulled to land , and he saw Gwendolen half raising herself on her hands , by her own effort , under her heavy covering of tarpaulin and pea-jackets -- pale as one of the sheeted dead , shivering , with wet hair streaming , a wild amazed consciousness in her eyes , as if she had waked up in a world where some judgment was impending , and the beings she saw around were coming to seize her .
