# text = The first rower who jumped to land was also wet through , and ran off ; the sailors , close about the boat , hindered Deronda from advancing , and he could only look on while Gwendolen gave sacred glances , and seemed to shrink with terror as she was carefully , tenderly helped out , and led on by the strong arms of those rough , bronzed men , her wet clothes clinging about her limbs , and adding to the impediment of her weakness .
