# text = The last thought made one wave with the impulse that sent Rex walking firmly into the house and through the open door of the study , where he saw his father packing a traveling-desk said Rex , with rallied courage , as his father looked up at him said Rex , beginning to strap a railway rug He forced himself to speak of Gwendolen for the first time , and the rector noticed the epoch with satisfaction he answered , taking the subject as a matter-of-course between them said Rex , getting more resolute after the first twinge had been borne said the rector , in his most decided manner Rex had never seen Grandcourt , had never been spoken to about him by any one of the family , and knew nothing of Gwendolen's flight from her suitor to Leubronn .
