# text = After the greeting between him and Hans , Mirah put her arm round her brother's neck and looked down at the letter in his hand , without the courage to ask about it , though she felt sure that it was the cause of his happiness said Mordecai , answering her look continued Mordecai , looking at Hans While Hans was answering Mirah slipped away to her own room ; but not to indulge in any outburst of the passion within her .
