# text = She answered more firmly , though it was the first time she had ever used accusing words to him said Lapidoth , putting back his handkerchief , but beginning with a voice that seemed to struggle against further sobbing Lapidoth had quickly conceived that he must guard against something unlikely , yet possible Mirah made no answer ; she could not bear to utter the only true one and she simply showed a wish that they should walk on , feeling that their standing still might draw down unpleasant notice .
