# text = It was as if he had found an added soul in finding his ancestry -- his judgment no longer wandering in the mazes of impartial sympathy , but choosing , with that partiality which is man's best strength , the closer fellowship that makes sympathy practical -- exchanging that bird's eye reasonableness which soars to avoid preference and loses all sense of quality for the generous reasonableness of drawing shoulder to shoulder with men of like inheritance .
