# text = All that brief experience of a quiet home which had once seemed a dullness to be fled from , now came back to her as a restful escape , a station where she found the breath of morning and the unreproaching voice of birds after following a lure through a long Satanic masquerade , which she had entered on with an intoxicated belief in its disguises , and had seen the end of in shrieking fear lest she herself had become one of the evil spirits who were dropping their human mummery and hissing around her with serpent tongues .
