# text = Hans shook his head said Hans , in a flighty way Deronda felt convinced that Hans was behaving artificially , but he trusted to a return of the old frankness by-and-by if he gave his own confidence he began said Hans , who had changed his attitude , laying one leg across the other and examining the heel of his slipper said Hans , speaking in a low tone , which was as usual with him as it was to be out of humor with his lot , and yet bent on making no fuss about it said Deronda Hans said nothing , but rose , seized his palette and began to work his brush on it , standing before his picture with his back to Deronda , who also felt himself at a break in his path embarrassed by Hans's embarrassment .
