# text = There was silence a little while , and to each the silence was like an irritating air , exaggerating discomfort said Hans , presently said Hans , with some irritation said Deronda , still heated by Hans' show of temper , and yet sorry for him Hans looked round hastily at his friend , but immediately turned to his picture again said Deronda , hurt by the idea that Hans suspected him of insincerity , and giving an offended emphasis to his words said Hans , as if he were vindicating himself said Hans , with bitter irony said Deronda , rising said Hans , but with no smile said Hans , impetuously , throwing down his tools , thrusting his hands into his coat-pockets , and turning round to face Deronda , who drew back a little and looked at him with amazement .
