# text = Perhaps in reward of his good behavior he gave his tongue the more freedom ; and he was too fully possessed by the notion of Deronda's happiness to have a conception of what lie was feeling about Gwendolen , so that he spoke of her without hesitation said Deronda , joining him in the grounds where he was making a study of the requisite bank and trees said Deronda said Deronda , quietly said Deronda , really interested said Deronda , ready to add that Hans's success in constructing her fortunes hitherto had not been enough to warrant a new attempt retorted Hans Deronda could say nothing , but he looked so much annoyed that Hans turned the current of his chat , and when he was alone shrugged his shoulders a little over the thought that there really had been some stronger feeling between Deronda and the duchess than Mirah would like to know of thought Hans , laughing at himself
