# text = There comes a terrible moment to many souls when the great movements of the world , the larger destinies of mankind , which have lain aloof in newspapers and other neglected reading , enter like an earthquake into their own lives -- where the slow urgency of growing generations turns into the tread of an invading army or the dire clash of civil war , and gray fathers know nothing to seek for but the corpses of their blooming sons , and girls forgot all vanity to make lint and bandages which may serve for the shattered limbs of their betrothed husbands .
